        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Home theater installation in New Braunfels typically ranges from $5,000 for a media room setup to $80,000+ for a fully dedicated theater room with acoustic treatment, tiered seating, 4K projection, and Dolby Atmos. Most of our Hill Country clients land somewhere between $15,000 and $40,000 for a serious dedicated theater. We start every project with a free in-home consultation: we look at your room, talk through what you want, and give you a real number before anything is committed."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you serve Canyon Lake, Gruene, Fischer, and Wimberley?",
