      <p class="text-body-lg text-stone mb-6 max-w-3xl reveal reveal-delay-2">New Braunfels is one of the fastest-growing cities in Texas, and with that growth comes significant custom home construction. We serve homeowners throughout New Braunfels and work with builders active in master-planned communities and rural custom lots alike.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why KZ -->
